  "raw_text": "PLAN \"Week 5 Deload\"\nTYPE workout\nVISIBILITY public\n\nGOALS\n  GOAL primary strength:\n    name \"Recover and dissipate fatigue before next block\"\n\nPHASES\n  PHASE \"Deload\" (1 weeks):\n    WEEK 1:\n      DAY Monday training 50m \"Upper Push and Pull Deload\":\n        warmup:\n          rowing 5m\n          arm_circles 1m\n          scapular_retraction 2x10\n        main straight_sets:\n          bench_press 3x6..8 rpe 6 rest 120 seconds\n          barbell_row 3x6..8 rpe 6 rest 120 seconds\n          shoulder_press 2x8..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          lat_pulldown 2x8..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          lateral_raise 2x10..12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          tricep_pushdown 2x10..12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          bicep_curl 2x10..12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          chest_stretch 60s\n          lat_stretch 60s\n          shoulder_stretch 60s\n      DAY Tuesday training 50m \"Lower Body Deload\":\n        warmup:\n          cycling 5m\n          leg_swings 1m\n          hip_circles 1m\n        main straight_sets:\n          squat 3x5..6 rpe 6 rest 150 seconds\n          romanian_deadlift 3x6..8 rpe 6 rest 120 seconds\n          leg_press 2x8..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          leg_curl 2x10..12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          standing_calf_raise 2x10..12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          plank 2x40s rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          hamstring_stretch 60s\n          quad_stretch 60s\n          hip_flexor_stretch 60s\n      DAY Wednesday rest:\n      DAY Thursday training 50m \"Upper Body Deload\":\n        warmup:\n          rowing 5m\n          arm_circles 1m\n          external_rotation 2x12\n        main straight_sets:\n          incline_press 3x6..8 rpe 6 rest 120 seconds\n          cable_row 3x8..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          dumbbell_press 2x8..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          pull_up 2x5..6 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          face_pull 2x12..15 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          skull_crusher 2x10..12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          hammer_curl 2x10..12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          tricep_stretch 60s\n          chest_stretch 60s\n          neck_stretch 60s\n      DAY Friday training 50m \"Lower Body and Posterior Chain Deload\":\n        warmup:\n          cycling 5m\n          leg_swings 1m\n          hip_circles 1m\n        main straight_sets:\n          trap_bar_deadlift 3x4..5 rpe 6 rest 150 seconds\n          front_squat 2x6..8 rpe 6 rest 120 seconds\n          hip_thrust 2x8..10 rpe 6 rest 90 seconds\n          leg_extension 2x10..12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          seated_calf_raise 2x10..12 rpe 6 rest 60 seconds\n          pallof_press 2x10..12 rpe 6 rest 45 seconds\n        cooldown:\n          pigeon_pose 60s\n          calf_stretch 60s\n          child_pose 60s\n      DAY Saturday rest:\n      DAY Sunday rest:",
